@Todo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5263
@resetToken = AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

GET {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Request a password reset (returns the same message for registered and unknown addresses)
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@example.com"
}

### Reset the password with the one-time token sent by email
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{resetToken}}",
  "password": "nova-senha-segura"
}

### Invalid or expired tokens return 400
POST {{Todo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB",
  "password": "nova-senha-segura"
}
